#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:2
msgid "Fragment Interaction Energy"
msgstr "片段相互作用能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:4
msgid ""
"The interaction between two water molecules changes their total energy. This tutorial calculates "
"that change for the S22 water dimer. You will define the two fragments, choose an active space, "
"and compare five electronic structure methods in one calculation."
msgstr "两个水分子之间的相互作用会改变它们的总能量。本教程计算 S22 水二聚体的这一能量变化。你将定义两个片段，选择活性空间，再用一次计算比较五种电子结构方法。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:10
msgid "From Fragments To Interaction Energy"
msgstr "从片段到相互作用能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:12
msgid ""
"Each water molecule is one fragment. We call them A and B, and call the complete dimer AB. For "
"each method, q2m3 calculates the interaction energy as"
msgstr "每个水分子构成一个片段。我们用 A 和 B 表示两个片段，用 AB 表示完整二聚体。对每种方法，q2m3 按下式计算相互作用能："

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:15
msgid "\\Delta E = E(AB) - E(A) - E(B)."
msgstr "\\Delta E = E(AB) - E(A) - E(B)."

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:19
msgid ""
"A negative value means that the dimer has lower energy than the separate fragments at the same "
"geometry. All three calculations use the dimer basis. For each monomer, the partner's atoms "
"retain their basis functions but contribute no nuclei or electrons. These are *ghost atoms*. This"
" procedure gives the counterpoise-corrected interaction energy."
msgstr ""
"负值表示二聚体的能量低于相同几何下两个独立片段的能量之和。三次计算都使用二聚体基组。计算单体时，另一片段的原子保留基函数，但不贡献原子核或电子。这些原子称为*鬼原子*。这一过程给出 "
"counterpoise 校正后的相互作用能。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:25
msgid ""
"The workflow first calculates Hartree–Fock (HF) and second-order Møller–Plesset perturbation "
"theory (MP2) energies. It then compares two methods within a selected active space: complete "
"active-space configuration interaction (CASCI) and sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD). A "
"frozen-core CCSD(T) calculation supplies a reference from the full orbital space when its "
"estimated cost fits the calculation budget."
msgstr ""
"工作流先计算 Hartree–Fock（HF）和二阶 Møller–Plesset "
"微扰理论（MP2）能量。随后，它在选定的活性空间内比较两种方法。第一种是完全活性空间组态相互作用（CASCI）。第二种是基于采样的量子对角化（SQD）。工作流估计冻结核 CCSD(T) "
"的成本。若成本符合计算预算，该计算提供全轨道空间参考。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:33
msgid "Prepare The Calculation"
msgstr "准备计算"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:35
msgid ""
"The example uses the default ``mode=\"full\"`` and the cc-pVDZ basis. Install the optional SQD "
"backend from the repository root:"
msgstr "本例使用默认的 ``mode=\"full\"`` 和 cc-pVDZ 基组。在仓库根目录安装可选的 SQD 后端："

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:42
msgid ""
"The SQD backend supports Linux x86_64. For a calculation with only core dependencies, use "
"``mode=\"classical_only\"`` in the ``run`` call below. This mode returns HF and MP2 energies and "
"the selected active spaces. It skips CASCI, SQD, CCSD(T), and resource estimates."
msgstr ""
"SQD 后端支持 Linux x86_64。若只安装了核心依赖，请在下方的 ``run`` 调用中使用 ``mode=\"classical_only\"``。该模式返回 HF、MP2 "
"能量及选定的活性空间。它跳过 CASCI、SQD、CCSD(T) 和资源估计。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:47
msgid ""
"Download :download:`water-dimer.xyz` into your working directory. The coordinates use Angstrom. "
"Atom indices start at zero, so atoms 0–2 form fragment A and atoms 3–5 form fragment B."
msgstr "将 :download:`water-dimer.xyz` 下载到工作目录。坐标单位为埃。原子索引从零开始，因此原子 0–2 构成片段 A，原子 3–5 构成片段 B。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:55
msgid "Choose The Active Space"
msgstr "选择活性空间"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:57
msgid ""
"CASCI and SQD treat the same selected electrons and orbitals explicitly. The atomic valence "
"active space (AVAS) procedure selects these orbitals from the atomic shells you specify. The "
"``avas_labels`` parameter identifies the shells, and ``avas_threshold`` controls the selection. "
"Both parameters require an explicit value."
msgstr ""
"CASCI 和 SQD 显式处理相同的选定电子与轨道。原子价活性空间（AVAS）方法根据你指定的原子壳层选择这些轨道。``avas_labels`` "
"参数指定壳层，``avas_threshold`` 控制选择。两个参数都需要显式赋值。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:63
msgid ""
"For this example, use ``avas_labels=[\"O 2p\", \"H 1s\"]`` and ``avas_threshold=0.7``. The "
"resulting spaces are:"
msgstr "本例使用 ``avas_labels=[\"O 2p\", \"H 1s\"]`` 和 ``avas_threshold=0.7``。得到的活性空间如下："

