msgid "Subsystem"
msgstr "子体系"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:70
msgid "Active electrons"
msgstr "活性电子数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:71
msgid "Active orbitals"
msgstr "活性轨道数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:72
msgid "SQD qubits"
msgstr "SQD 量子比特数"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:73
msgid "Dimer AB"
msgstr "二聚体 AB"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:74
msgid "12"
msgstr "12"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:75
#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:80
#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:84
msgid "8"
msgstr "8"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:76
msgid "16"
msgstr "16"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:77
msgid "Monomer A"
msgstr "单体 A"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:78
#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:82
msgid "6"
msgstr "6"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:79
#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:83
msgid "4"
msgstr "4"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:81
msgid "Monomer B"
msgstr "单体 B"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:86
msgid ""
"An element label such as ``\"O 2p\"`` selects that shell on every oxygen atom. An indexed label "
"such as ``\"0 O 2p\"`` refers only to atom 0 in the full geometry. q2m3 applies the same labels "
"to all three subsystems and retains only labels on real atoms in each monomer."
msgstr ""
"``\"O 2p\"`` 这样的元素标签会选择每个氧原子的相应壳层。``\"0 O 2p\"`` 这样的索引标签仅指向完整几何中的原子 0。q2m3 "
"将相同标签应用于三个子体系。对每个单体，它仅保留真实原子上的标签。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:91
msgid ""
"The current workflow accepts at most 10 active orbitals per subsystem. For these labels, the "
"PySCF default threshold of 0.2 selects 12 orbitals for the dimer. The example uses 0.7 to obtain "
"the smaller spaces above. q2m3 also checks that the monomer active spaces correspond to the dimer"
" active space before it calculates correlated energies."
msgstr ""
"当前工作流允许每个子体系最多有 10 个活性轨道。对于这些标签，PySCF 默认阈值 0.2 会为二聚体选择 12 个轨道。本例使用 0.7，以得到上表中的较小空间。计算相关能量前，q2m3 "
"还会检查单体活性空间与二聚体活性空间的对应关系。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:98
msgid "Calculate And Display The Energies"
msgstr "计算并显示能量"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:100
msgid ""
"Run the following Python code from the directory containing ``water-dimer.xyz``. "
"``Molecule.from_xyz`` assigns the atoms to the two fragments. ``run`` calculates their "
"interaction energies, and ``render_report`` formats the result as Markdown."
msgstr ""
"在包含 ``water-dimer.xyz`` 的目录中运行以下 Python 代码。``Molecule.from_xyz`` 将原子分配到两个片段。``run`` "
"计算相互作用能。``render_report`` 将结果格式化为 Markdown。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:135
msgid ""
"The report currently uses Chinese headings. Its energy columns give :math:`\\Delta E` in Hartree "
"(Ha) and kcal/mol. In this example, every method gives a negative interaction energy. SQD gives "
"about −3.557 kcal/mol, close to the CASCI value of −3.574 kcal/mol within the same active space."
msgstr ""
"报告目前使用中文标题。能量列以 Hartree（Ha）和 kcal/mol 给出 :math:`\\Delta E`。本例中，每种方法都得到负的相互作用能。SQD 给出约 −3.557 "
"kcal/mol，接近同一活性空间内 CASCI 的 −3.574 kcal/mol。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:140
msgid ""
"The ``result`` object also stores the energies, active spaces, and resource estimates for AB, A, "
"and B. Use ``result.delta_e`` to access the interaction energies in Hartree. Continue with "
":doc:`Read A Fragment Interaction Report <fragment-report>` to interpret the method differences "
"and resource estimates."
msgstr ""
"``result`` 对象还保存 AB、A、B 的能量、活性空间和资源估计。使用 ``result.delta_e`` 可读取 Hartree 单位的相互作用能。继续阅读 "
":doc:`解读片段相互作用能报告 <fragment-report>`，了解方法差异和资源估计。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:148
msgid "Adapt The Calculation"
msgstr "调整计算"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:150
msgid ""
"For another dimer, replace the geometry and fragment indices first. Then choose AVAS labels for "
"the shells relevant to that interaction. Inspect the selected spaces before you compare energies "
"across geometries."
msgstr "对于另一个二聚体，先替换几何和片段索引。再为相关壳层选择 AVAS 标签。比较不同几何的能量前，检查选定的活性空间。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:154
msgid ""
"If the selected monomer and dimer spaces do not correspond, q2m3 raises "
"``ActiveSpaceMismatchError``. Revisit the labels and threshold for the whole dimer. "
"``FragmentWorkflowError`` can also indicate an unsupported active space, such as one without an "
"active virtual orbital or with more than 10 orbitals. The exception message identifies the "
"subsystem and the failed condition."
msgstr ""
"若选定的单体与二聚体活性空间不对应，q2m3 会抛出 "
"``ActiveSpaceMismatchError``。请重新检查整个二聚体的标签和阈值。``FragmentWorkflowError`` "
"也可能表示活性空间不受支持。例如，空间中没有活性虚轨道，或轨道数超过 10 个。异常消息会指出子体系和未满足的条件。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:160
msgid ""
"To compare against a reference calculation, add ``references=[\"refs.csv\"]`` to the ``run`` "
"call. The CSV needs these columns:"
msgstr "若要与参考计算比较，请在 ``run`` 调用中添加 ``references=[\"refs.csv\"]``。CSV 需要以下列："

