msgid "``basis``"
msgstr "``basis``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:173
msgid "The reference basis"
msgstr "参考基组"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:174
msgid "``delta_e``"
msgstr "``delta_e``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:175
msgid "The reference interaction energy"
msgstr "参考相互作用能"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:176
msgid "``unit``"
msgstr "``unit``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:177
msgid "``Ha``, ``kcal/mol``, or ``kJ/mol``"
msgstr "``Ha``、``kcal/mol`` 或 ``kJ/mol``"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:179
msgid ""
"Use a reference for the same geometry and interaction-energy definition. q2m3 classifies a row "
"with the calculation basis as a same-basis reference. It classifies a row with another basis as "
"an external reference. Supply at most one reference in each category. The next tutorial explains "
"how these references enter the energy comparisons."
msgstr "请使用相同几何和相互作用能定义的参考。q2m3 将基组与当前计算相同的行归为同基组参考。它将使用其他基组的行归为外部参考。每类最多提供一个参考。下一篇教程解释这些参考如何参与能量比较。"

#: ../../source/tutorials/fragment-interaction.rst:185
msgid ""
"Keep the geometry and calculation settings with your result. ``result.provenance`` records the "
"geometry hash, basis, AVAS settings, seed, package versions, and thread settings. Use these "
"records when you repeat the calculation or compare results from different environments."
msgstr "请随结果保存几何和计算设置。``result.provenance`` 记录几何哈希、基组、AVAS 设置、种子、软件包版本和线程设置。重复计算或比较不同环境的结果时，请使用这些记录。"
